      "content": "Interesting. You put James at the top, but I'm curious why you didn't place Marcus Washington higher. He's got a Harvard JD and is an expert in high-stakes negotiations—that sounds like it would translate perfectly to \"commanding a room\" in a boardroom setting. What is it about his profile that makes him a less ideal fit for \"executive presence\" compared to James?",
